#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: widgets/administratorsettingsdialog/cas/cassettingswidget.cpp:51
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When enabled, Rocket.Chat will trust that any username from CAS belongs to the same user on Rocket.Chat.\n"
"This may be needed if a user is renamed on CAS, but may also allow people to take control of Rocket.Chat accounts by renaming their own CAS users."
msgstr ""
"Se se activa, Rocket.Chat confiará en que calquera nome de persoa usuaria de CAS corresponda á persoa usuaria equivalente en Rocket.Chat.\n"
"Isto pode ser necesario se unha persoa usuaria se renomea en CAS, pero tamén pode permitir a xente tomar o control de contas de Rocket.Chat cambiando o seu nome de persoa usuaria en CAS."

#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: widgets/administratorsettingsdialog/cas/cassettingswidget.cpp:56
#, kde-format
